You got to be shitting me.

481
00:21:52,536 --> 00:21:54,549
I'm sorry, Johnny.
you know I like my boys young.

482
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:56,050
And you just aren't so anymore.

483
00:21:56,697 --> 00:21:57,950
Oh, let them go, honey.

484
00:22:00,367 --> 00:22:02,450
You're in for the best afternoon

485
00:22:03,233 --> 00:22:04,399
of your life!

486
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:10,571
We have almost the same blood.

487
00:22:11,750 --> 00:22:13,050
How did my life go so wrong?

488
00:22:13,984 --> 00:22:16,050
Genetic mutations can be so cruel.

489
00:22:21,650 --> 00:22:23,253
- This is Sam.
- Hey Sam.

490
00:22:23,850 --> 00:22:25,934
- When you get a second, can we talk?
- Sure.

491
00:22:26,131 --> 00:22:27,366
Thanks.

492
00:22:28,634 --> 00:22:30,126
I think I'm in trouble.

493
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:32,396
I'll be right back.

494
00:22:32,499 --> 00:22:34,213
So. How was the day, boys?

495
00:22:34,350 --> 00:22:36,749
Well, Drama's got
the cleanest asshole in America

496
00:22:36,903 --> 00:22:39,183
and I learned that
passion begins after 40.

497
00:22:39,421 --> 00:22:41,839
- So I'd say it was a pretty good day.
- It sounds like it.

498
00:22:42,250 --> 00:22:43,350
Yo, what's up?

499
00:22:45,086 --> 00:22:46,346
Can you guys give us a minute?

500
00:22:46,950 --> 00:22:48,924
- It's my house, E.
- Johnny.

501
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:50,729
Yeah, sure, bro.

502
00:22:50,861 --> 00:22:53,415
Yeah, who knows? Maybe I'll even
take a girl from you this time.

503
00:22:53,449 --> 00:22:55,627
- because I am on a hot streak.
- Shut up.

504
00:22:55,936 --> 00:22:58,532
Yeah, this ain't a house.
It's a condo and it ain't a big one.

505
00:23:00,050 --> 00:23:01,100
So you're mad at me?

506
00:23:01,250 --> 00:23:03,512
- You called me pizza boy.
- No, I didn't.

507
00:23:03,650 --> 00:23:05,833
Yeah, you did.
You called me pizza boy just like Ari.

508
00:23:06,450 --> 00:23:09,017
I was pissed.
I was down 100 grand on a soccer game.

509
00:23:09,250 --> 00:23:11,393
- What?
- Yeah, don't worry. I got it all back.

510
00:23:11,743 --> 00:23:14,822
- And I won $100,000 on Brazil.
- Are you fucking kidding me?

511
00:23:14,950 --> 00:23:15,984
No,

512
00:23:16,150 --> 00:23:18,363
Come on.
You wanna hit the palm for lobbies?

513
00:23:19,750 --> 00:23:21,550
Come on, it's a good day.

514
00:23:21,750 --> 00:23:23,950
- No it's not. I'm pissed.
- I'm sorry.

515
00:23:24,350 --> 00:23:25,949
You know what?
Don't give me that shit.

516
00:23:25,950 --> 00:23:28,549
You know, you tell me
I'm not a filmmaker, and that's fine.

517
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:30,458
But you know what?
I found the script.

518
00:23:30,550 --> 00:23:32,864
You didn't and Ari didn't.
I picked the director.

519
00:23:33,150 --> 00:23:35,277
And I got somebody to buy this movie

520
00:23:35,337 --> 00:23:37,250
and bail us out
of our financial problems.

521
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:39,650
- What do you mean?
- I brought it to Harvey.

522
00:23:40,226 --> 00:23:43,050
He wants it, Vince.
I got him to make us an offer.

523
00:23:43,403 --> 00:23:45,863
$25 million.
It takes final cut away from Billy.

524
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:48,378
It's what's best for us
and it's what's best for the movie.

525
00:23:48,463 --> 00:23:49,698
- You got an offer?
- Yeah.

526
00:23:49,783 --> 00:23:51,138
And if we get rejected from Cannes

527
00:23:51,189 --> 00:23:53,724
and that goes public we may
never get an offer like that again.

528
00:23:53,758 --> 00:23:55,108
You got an offer off a trailer?

529
00:23:57,838 --> 00:23:59,346
That is amazing.

530
00:23:59,746 --> 00:24:01,450
Yeah, I can spin some dough, huh?

531
00:24:01,700 --> 00:24:02,750
Look, E,

532
00:24:03,209 --> 00:24:04,946
I know you're doing
what you think is best,

533
00:24:05,049 --> 00:24:06,709
and I was wrong
about what I said today.

534
00:24:06,950 --> 00:24:09,656
And I do appreciate how much
you really have done. I really do.

535
00:24:10,250 --> 00:24:12,050
But is it possible you're wrong too?

536
00:24:12,450 --> 00:24:13,709
- How?
- About the movie.

537
00:24:13,859 --> 00:24:16,121
Maybe you really are too close.
Is that possible?

538
00:24:17,150 --> 00:24:20,150
Maybe, but I'd like to be protected
in case we don't get into Cannes.

539
00:24:20,470 --> 00:24:21,739
We did get into Cannes.

540
00:24:22,186 --> 00:24:23,197
What?

541
00:24:23,250 --> 00:24:25,906
The movie got into Cannes.
I just talked to Walsh an hour ago.

542
00:24:26,250 --> 00:24:28,771
- I don't believe it.
- Well, believe it, because you made...

543
00:24:28,874 --> 00:24:30,606
We made a great film.

544
00:24:30,750 --> 00:24:33,339
A film I don't think we should
sell until we get to the festival.

545
00:24:33,407 --> 00:24:34,513
We got into Cannes?

546
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:36,250
Maybe you should watch it again.

547
00:24:36,583 --> 00:24:37,650
Maybe.

